Profile: MethemoglobinStandard
Parent: $KDSLab
Id: methemoglobin-standard
Title: "Methemoglobin in blood (quantitative)"
Description: "Observation profile for Methemoglobin in blood (quantitative) (standard test). code bound to the curated methemoglobin-standard ValueSet; specimen Blood."
* code from https://interpolar.example/fhir/ValueSet/methemoglobin-standard (required)
* value[x] only Quantity
* valueQuantity.unit = "% or g/dL"  // expected unit
* specimen only Reference(Specimen)  // Blood
